Package: tidychat
Title: Tidy Tools for Batch LLM Annotation and Extraction
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(
      given = "Seung Hyun",
      family = "Min",
      role = c("aut", "cre"),
      email = "seung.min@mail.mcgill.ca"
    )
Description: Provides tidy tools for batch annotation and structured extraction 
  using Large Language Models (LLMs). Supports multiple independent draws per 
  item with built-in uncertainty quantification, making it ideal for systematic 
  text analysis, literature reviews, and reproducible research workflows. 
  Compatible with Ollama, Gemini, OpenAI, Anthropic, Groq, and DeepSeek APIs.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://smin95.github.io/tidychat/
BugReports: https://github.com/smin95/tidychat/issues/
